Gemma 4 E4B SinhalaMMLU

This distribution includes weights, configuration, tokenizer and chat-template
material derived from Google/Google DeepMind's google/gemma-4-E4B-it model.
Upstream model: https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-4-E4B-it
Gemma 4 license: https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/gemma_4_license

Modifications by the sinhala-mmlu contributors, 2026:
Sinhala curriculum reasoning distillation with merged language-model LoRA,
followed by 50/50 interpolation with the base weights. Model packaging,
evaluation summaries, and inference/further-training documentation and code
are provided with this release. See MODIFICATIONS.md and provenance.json.

